[gd_scene format=3]

; The one variable: the fractional width of a centred Button, which puts its text's canvas-item
; origin off a whole pixel. Godot floors a glyph's origin in the item (text_server_adv.cpp:4082-4084).
; The project font draws on the canvas painter, where the snap applies.

